<title>UK: BOE allots 925 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 925 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said it provided the UK money market with a further 925 million stg of assistance at established interest rates.</p>
<p>It allotted 650 million stg outright and 275 million stg in repos to July 28. Earlier the Bank forecast a liquidity shortage of 1.15 billion stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
